  "content": [
    {
      "text": "The Hebrew name for Egypt. Mizraim was the son of Ham, son of Noah (Gen. 10:6). He was the ancestor of the Hamitic people of lower Egypt and Africa and of the Hamitic people of Canaan and several associated peoples (Gen. 10:13–20).",
